        "created_at": "2016-04-25T20:21:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There are lots of obvious Bloodsworn Colosseum titles that boost heroes, but what are some of the fun and unusual combos you've managed to get?</p><p>My favorite so far was \"Mr. Fixer, the Mindbreaking Seeker\" who used his Dual Crowbars to go to town on an arena full of gladiators -- After being plinked for 1 damage, he did 2 damage to each of his fellow heroes, followed each time by 3 point hits on villain targets.&nbsp; Then those were followed by 4 point hits on villain targets, followed by 5 point hits on more villain targets.&nbsp; I lost track of the totals, but it was an obscene amount of damage and my fastest arena win yet.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
