        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"seesome\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/seesome/48/2018_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> seesome:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span>My favorite so far was \"Mr. Fixer, the Mindbreaking Seeker\" who used his Dual Crowbars to go to town on an arena full of gladiators – After being plinked for 1 damage, he did 2 damage to each of his fellow heroes, followed each time by 3 point hits on villain targets.&nbsp; Then those were followed by 4 point hits on villain targets, followed by 5 point hits on more villain targets.&nbsp; I lost track of the totals, but it was an obscene amount of damage and my fastest arena win yet.</span></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>I had this today - four to you, seven to Kaargra. Four to you, seven to Kaargra. Four to you… oh, she's dead.</span></p>",
