        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-04-26T15:27:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was once playing as Omni-10 and ended up with a whole stack of titles on me, such that the first time I was dealt damage each turn I would immediately deal every target two irreducible Psychic damage thanks to the combination I had somehow managed to (pretty much entirely by accident) have build up on myself. I think there may have been another title or two on me as well, but I can't remember which one(s). The ones I had were enough to basically kill us all within a couple of rounds, anyway, lol.</p>",
